{"server":"en","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-02_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-02","title":"A Walk in the Rain","storyCode":"4-2","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"538affa3b62933b883ef82ec86ce7ee2a044ec68aef934e255f85fb6778790b0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"In the slums, Amiya meets an Infected child, whose liveliness once against gives her pangs of indecision. \nShe also runs into Ch'en, but this Ch'en has a look in her eyes that is nothing like that of the person she knows.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ahh...! Look out!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ouch!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"S-sorry, I didn't mean to run into you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry about it. You're very polite."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ehehe..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Um, ma'am, what are you doing here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's still raining. You're not going to go inside?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah, um... I'm just... taking a walk."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you looking for help?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Oh! How'd you know?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't tell you~ It's a secret."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Aw... it's fine though!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ma'am, do you think..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm... that probably won't work. You're a bit too short..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey, you shouldn't say stuff like that! You're shorter than me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Whoa!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"W-well, we could try... Um, could you help me move that board? Let's do it together!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"There's a record player under that metal rack. I want to take it back home."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"1... 2... 3! Together!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We did it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Woah, you're really strong, ma'am! Thank you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But... this record player is broken."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's okay! It's always been broken."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"But one day, I'll be able to fix it. I collected a lot of records, but I've never listened to them before..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...But one day, I'll play them for everyone!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Such a difficult thing, said so casually..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...What am I doing this for... What can I even do..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ma'am, you're not scared of me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Scared of what?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I'm an Infected!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Haha... I am too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What?! That's such a pity. You're so pretty, too...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"There's nothing wrong with being an Infected. Whether you are healthy or infected..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"If you're a good person, that will never change."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Huh...? I don't get it..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"(Grrrrrr...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Are you hungry?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...Mmhm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Here, take this. It's all I have."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Wow! Thank you, ma'am!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"But... why did you come here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's because..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's because I made a promise to someone."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Bye bye, ma'am!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure, bye bye!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Even a child like that... In the end, will just..."},{"type":"narration","text":"Those who were robbed of their identity. The Infected. You've long lost the right to call yourselves people."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"What can I accomplish? What more... can I do...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Why... can I not protect those around me..."},{"type":"narration","text":"You cannot."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No... I..."},{"type":"narration","text":"Famine... Persecution... Death...\nThese are the only things awaiting the Infected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No, that's not true..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"As long as Rhodes Island is fighting for the Infected..."},{"type":"narration","text":"You are but one of the few lucky ones."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No... We've all come together to fight towards a common goal."},{"type":"narration","text":"This world has already become cold and callous."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No, not yet..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The Infected can't succumb to despair just yet..."},{"type":"narration","text":"You.\nAllow the rage to consume you.\nOnly then..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No... I won't..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I made a promise..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I made a promise to her...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Who's that...?"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_31_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"A big sister once told me that these dolls won't work unless you make them yourself."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"So that's why I'm giving this to you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Another Girl's Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"That voice just now...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"That silhouette..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_31_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Is that Madam Ch'en?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"------"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"------------"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Little Girl","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"------!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Another Girl's Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"... ..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_31_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en, what are you doing here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I thought you were..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"None of your concern."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"This is Lungmen's business, and I will take care of it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_31_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"This is the first time..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I've seen that look in her eyes..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["Ch'en"]}]}
